{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38887","headline":"乱後逢村叟 · 杜荀鹤","name":"乱後逢村叟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"经乱衰翁居破村，村中何事不伤魂。\n因供寨木无桑柘，爲着乡兵绝子孙。\n还似平宁徵赋税，未尝州县畧安存。\n至於鸡犬皆星散，日落前山独倚门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38887.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38887","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}